# Licence

This project is dual-licensed, because it contains two different kinds of work.

## Documentation — CC BY 4.0

`SKILL.md`, everything in `references/`, and `ATTRIBUTION.md` are licensed under the
**Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence**.

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially, provided you
give appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate if changes were made.

This choice is not arbitrary. The phase architecture of this skill — a router with
distinct entry points, a mandatory intent phase, recursive scoring against weighted
criteria with explicit stopping criteria, and a multi-perspective review panel — is
adapted from the **creative-director** skill by **Serge Shima**, which is licensed
CC BY 4.0 and requires attribution. Keeping the same licence downstream keeps that
obligation visible rather than buried.

  creative-director © Serge Shima — https://github.com/smixs/creative-director-skill
  Licensed CC BY 4.0.

Full credits, including every source behind the duration and easing values, are in
`ATTRIBUTION.md`.

