## Third-party values

Duration and easing values quoted in `references/` are factual specifications published
by their owners — Material Design (Apache-2.0), IBM Carbon (Apache-2.0), Atlassian,
Microsoft Fluent (MIT), and others. Each is cited at the point of use and in
`ATTRIBUTION.md`. No third-party source code, artwork, or media is redistributed here.

Device frames rendered by `scripts/make_reel.py` are drawn procedurally from primitive
shapes. They are generic representations, not any manufacturer's industrial design, and
no device imagery is bundled.
